                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Which branch\nshould receive the\nbackup copy in\nthis practice\npacket?",
                                        "Do not resend\nevery confirmed\ndelivery just to\nlook busy.\nIdentify",
                                        "the unmatched sent\nentry and use the\nassigned backup\nduty. Moxie",
                                        "puts her finger\nbeside the three\nsignatures and\nwaits for a",
                                        "destination, not\nan instruction to\nride around until\nsomebody feels",
                                        "reassured."
